units.rawText:
@Shy Miko
<size=32>I just finished patrolling the entire Oasis. All facilities in the Sector are in good condition and I detected no signs of <a href=Des:58>Entropic</a> activity.</size><|>
@Shy Miko
<size=32>I've made several such circuits since I joined. The work is not boring, but the lack of company makes it somewhat lonely.</size><|>
@Shy Miko
<size=32>A friend recommended that I post here to look for others who think the way I do, and so I hope I can find colleagues of like mind to go on patrols with me.</size>

